      "short": "Further simplify $\\sqrt{50}$: $2\\sqrt{50}=10\\sqrt2$.",
      "worked": "Samira's working is correct, but 50 still has the square factor 25.\n$$\\begin{align*}2\\sqrt{50}&=2\\sqrt{25\\times2}\\\\&=2\\times5\\sqrt2\\\\&=10\\sqrt2\\end{align*}$$",
